{"text":"the color of my skin. Many countries, including the United States, grapple with questions of identity and inequality and how we treat each other, people who are different than us, how we deal with diversity of beliefs and of faiths. Right now, in crowded neighborhoods not far from here, a man is driving an auto rickshaw or washing somebody else's clothes or doing the hard work no one else will do, and a young man is on a bicycle delivering lunch, a little girl is hauling a heavy bucket of water. And I believe their dreams, their hopes, are just as important, just as beautiful, just as worthy as ours.","words":[{"text":"the","start":0.0,"end":0.12},{"text":"color","start":0.12,"end":0.3},{"text":"of","start":0.3,"end":0.46},{"text":"my","start":0.46,"end":0.6},{"text":"skin","start":0.6,"end":0.86,"punct":"."},{"text":"Many","start":3.96,"end":4.44},{"text":"countries","start":4.44,"end":4.88,"punct":","},{"text":"including","start":5.38,"end":5.68},{"text":"the","start":5.68,"end":6.1},{"text":"United","start":6.1,"end":6.28},{"text":"States","start":6.28,"end":6.76,"punct":","},{"text":"grapple","start":7.38,"end":7.86},{"text":"with","start":7.86,"end":8.34},{"text":"questions","start":8.34,"end":8.72},{"text":"of","start":8.72,"end":8.92},{"text":"identity","start":8.92,"end":9.36},{"text":"and","start":9.36,"end":9.8},{"text":"inequality","start":9.8,"end":10.28},{"text":"and","start":10.28,"end":10.72},{"text":"how","start":10.72,"end":10.88},{"text":"we","start":10.88,"end":11.06},{"text":"treat","start":11.06,"end":11.32},{"text":"each","start":11.32,"end":11.54},{"text":"other","start":11.54,"end":11.74,"punct":","},{"text":"people","start":12.46,"end":12.7},{"text":"who","start":12.7,"end":12.88},{"text":"are","start":12.88,"end":12.96},{"text":"different","start":12.96,"end":13.28},{"text":"than","start":13.28,"end":13.48},{"text":"us","start":13.48,"end":13.76,"punct":","},{"text":"how","start":14.02,"end":14.2},{"text":"we","start":14.2,"end":14